{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0821/9a508a1b6f18198.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>不少網友吐槽該新功能「難看」「反人類設計」「強迫症好痛苦」，且不支持手動關閉。也有網友吐槽更新後複製粘貼內容不方便，紛紛呼籲關閉此功能。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0821/1153a6756cc27ac.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>此前，騰訊客服表示：「可按住轉文字」是微信輸入框的一個功能，您只需長按聊天輸入框，然後按住麥克風圖標説話，鬆開後語音就會自動轉為文字。該功能目前僅在iOS客户端進行灰度測試，Android及鴻蒙客户端還在開發中。如果您的微信版本較新，建議您查看手機系統更新情況哦。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0821/890ddf1355893b5.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0821/4173129c5b7f9d9.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0821/9a508a1b6f18198.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0821/1153a6756cc27ac.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0821/890ddf1355893b5.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T13:39:45.718865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":7,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}